OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo sees passenger plane
OL,4,Aleave runway
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh winds caused a passenger plane to
OL,7,Fmomentarily leave the runway at
OL,8,FBirmingham Airport as Storm Boleo
OL,9,Fbrought disruption across the West
OL,10,FMidlands.
OL,12,FJet2 said flight LS1310 from Venice
OL,13,Fmoved off the runway after landing on
OL,14,FSunday afternoon due to "exceptional
OL,15,Fweather conditions" caused by the
OL,16,Fstorm.
OL,18,FThe airline said the aircraft
OL,19,Fimmediately returned to the runway and
OL,20,Flater taxied to its stand, with all
OL,21,Fpassengers disembarking normally.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
